This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Shard f of review-shard-merge runs units run_rec and bl808: record-only-diff.sh and the partition and merge in place over mktemp worlds whose inputs are copies of located files. The subjects resolve their siblings from their own path, and every mutant is skipped on a consumer anyway. A consumer runs the shipped shards a-d, which keep the located recorder hook, seal and wait-for-deliverable, and the arms that read the installed role, gate and QA files.
